# FOREWORD

- This Qualification Standard (QS) for the Cyber OP MOSID 00378 is issued on the authority of the Commander of Military Personnel Generation Training Group (MPGTG).

- This QS is based upon the AMCN for Cyber OP MOSID 00378 found in Cyber Op 00378 dated 18 02 2023.

- This QS was developed in collaboration with representatives from from the Directorate of Cyber Operations Force Development (D Cyber Ops FD) Kingston, the Canadian Forces Network Operations Centre (CFNOC), and the Canadian Forces Information Operations Group Head Quarters (CFIOG HQ).

- It was prepared in accordance with (IAW) the concept of training outlined in the A-P9-050 Series, Canadian Forces Manuals of Individual Training and Education.

- This publication is effective upon receipt.

- Suggestions for secretarial amendments or review shall be actioned IAW TGSO 1104.

