| 18 | These are added to the existing tasks FT0300 (maintain custom network toolsets), FT0340 (build custom testing environment), FT0280 (develop custom network toolsets) FT0290 (test custom network tools) FT0290 The tool may be used for network assessment but could be for other purposes | As per Ser #3 |
