| 28 | **PO 002** para 3.a.1. changed name to “Develop network sensor rules” para 3. c.1.Selecting and collecting relevant windows host and AD logs. Para 3.c.1.a. Active directory overview and logging Security and audit logs Logon logs Other logs relevant to security logs AD protocols Para3. c.2. Identifying exploits in host logs Binary exploits Windows exploits Identify indicators of malicious activity Updated sub para’s and better explained sub tasks. | Nil |
