| 42 | Discussed the documented attacks and their purpose for the PO, moved them to examples and reworded a.1. to better reflect the methods, not the actual attacks. The intent of the cryptography exploitation is more of a general understanding and less about making them super hackers The verbiage needs to reflect that the candidate can recognize the attacks (level 2 maybe 3) Added remarks to show they will be given step by step and not need to implement towards a new concept. | As per Ser #3 |
| 43 | New task, Explaining attacks on miss-implemented cryptography. **PO 003** – added BT0270, Generate authorized adverse effects on target network devices. Moved back to this PO vice having it on PO 006 after assessment that the actual effects are not advanced. | As per Ser #3 |
